# =============================================================================
# CODE-ONLY repository: data, model fits, caches, rendered notebooks and figures
# are never committed. Ignore every file, then re-include only code / docs.
# =============================================================================
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.R
!*.Rmd
!*.Rproj
!README.md
!LICENSE*

# never descend into data / output folders, even if they contain code-like files
.Rproj.user/
data/
fits*/
cache/
output_figs*/
renv/library/
*_files/
